# Prettier's HTML formatter doesn't understand LWC's unquoted brace binding
# syntax (attr={expr}, for:each={list}, lwc:if={cond}) and rewrites it back
# to quoted attr="{expr}", which the LWC compiler then treats as ambiguous
# and refuses to compile. Exclude LWC templates until a template-aware
# formatter is available.
force-app/main/default/lwc/**/*.html
